# Temporary: dump raw Opendir_B5/Readdir_B5 output for struct-layout
# confirmation. See decomp/src/fastlaunch_scan_debug_test.c.
#
# Previously used "continue, wait ~2s, Ctrl+C" — imprecise, human-timing
# dependent, and results varied run to run in ways that turned out to be
# about WHEN the interrupt landed, not the code under test. Breakpointing
# on the test wrapper's own infinite loop (address known exactly, since we
# control the injection) makes every run land at the same, fully-settled
# point with zero timing ambiguity.
breakpoint $4a02
continue
examine/64 $d700
